%% Version simplificada para diapositiva. La completa: 03-secuencia-compra.mmd
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Comprador
    participant G as Gateway
    participant R as Reservas
    participant P as Pagos
    participant B as Broker
    participant N as Notificaciones

    C->>G: POST /reservas + idempotency-key
    G->>R: reenvia con correlation id
    R->>R: 1 - reservar cupo (bloqueo optimista)
    R->>R: 2 - calcular tarifa (Strategy)
    R->>P: 3 - cobrar (Adapter)
    P-->>R: aprobado
    R->>R: 4 - confirmar
    R-)B: reserva.confirmada
    R-->>G: 201 Created
    G-->>C: 201 Created

    Note over C,N: Aqui termina la espera del comprador

    B->>N: arrendar (competing consumers)
    N->>N: correo, SMS y push (Observer)
